{"3172160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Avante! Atlantis", "steam_appid": 3172160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WELCOME TO AVANTE! ATLANTIS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dbaf8ac76f219fb574d7bda343b2dba9.avif?t=1784201369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras_big/dbaf8ac76f219fb574d7bda343b2dba9.avif?t=1784201369 width=1560 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The future of humanity will not be decided on a battlefield,</strong> <strong>...but inside a virtual board game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead elite Strategists through a virtual war to decide how humanity will face the mysterious island of Atlantis. Positioning, map control and long-term planning matter more than brute force, while a touch of unpredictability keeps every battle fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY BEGINS → A World on the Brink</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/d2bfe4e605877c07905777b2d0801c1d.avif?t=1784201369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras_big/d2bfe4e605877c07905777b2d0801c1d.webp?t=1784201369 width=1560 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sudden appearance of Atlantis pushes humanity to the edge of another global war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to reach the island, the world's greatest nations settle their dispute inside <i>A.V.A.N.T.E.</i>, the world's most advanced military simulation, where the winning Strategist will decide humanity's first approach to the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WAYS TO PLAY → Choose Your Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dd88316d1b84bb280c52f152ed91bde3.poster.avif?t=1784201369\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dd88316d1b84bb280c52f152ed91bde3.webm?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/dd88316d1b84bb280c52f152ed91bde3.mp4?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose how you play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the computer, challenge friends locally or online, and choose between quick skirmishes or longer tactical matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DICE SYSTEM → Strategy With a Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/0438abc2b37d18dd778ffb2563d20bd6.poster.avif?t=1784201369\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/0438abc2b37d18dd778ffb2563d20bd6.webm?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/0438abc2b37d18dd778ffb2563d20bd6.mp4?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every battle is predictable... until it isn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom dice system introduces controlled randomness to combat, creating memorable moments without replacing strategy. Smart decisions will always matter more than luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CHARACTERS → More Than Strategists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/8190ec5c590bccb5003ea41e6e6252eb.avif?t=1784201369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras_big/8190ec5c590bccb5003ea41e6e6252eb.avif?t=1784201369 width=1560 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every character has a story to tell.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the Strategists competing for humanity's future. Each one brings unique abilities, distinct personalities, and their own answer to the mystery of Atlantis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARSENAL → 20 Unique Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ab1e65899b7a00436fb541e7facbdc12.poster.avif?t=1784201369\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ab1e65899b7a00436fb541e7facbdc12.webm?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/ab1e65899b7a00436fb541e7facbdc12.mp4?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your army from twenty unique units, each designed around a clear tactical role.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine infantry, armor and  weapons to create strategies that match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD → 8 Biomes, Endless Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/c21bac453f7cd17106d5614a24e1e46a.poster.avif?t=1784201369\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/c21bac453f7cd17106d5614a24e1e46a.webm?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/c21bac453f7cd17106d5614a24e1e46a.mp4?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two battlefields need to feel the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match eight handcrafted biomes to create unique battlefields filled with defensive terrain, hazards, healing zones and strategic opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EDITOR → Create Your Own Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/bb7c284e8d46c473cb770dad42d01fa9.poster.avif?t=1784201369\" width=1170 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/bb7c284e8d46c473cb770dad42d01fa9.webm?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/bb7c284e8d46c473cb770dad42d01fa9.mp4?t=1784201369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control of the battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own maps, combine biomes, craft challenging encounters and share them with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atlantis is no